luaconf.h: LUA_COMPAT_OPENLIB undefined, so the 5.0 registration function keeps its own name
luaI_openlib (no luaL_openlib alias). Codegen is unchanged; this only fixes the symbol name.

Justification: iOS 10-29 (same source family as PLAYER) names it luaI_openlib at 0x00825acc; PLAYER
0x00875df0 is that body (identical either way).

--- a/luaconf.h
+++ b/luaconf.h
@@ -364,7 +364,7 @@
 ** CHANGE it to undefined as soon as you replace to 'luaL_register'
 ** your uses of 'luaL_openlib'
 */
-#define LUA_COMPAT_OPENLIB
+#undef LUA_COMPAT_OPENLIB  /* ROBLOX */
 
 
 
